<title>UK: Banco Credibanco sets $50 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Credibanco sets $50 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO CREDIBANCO SA (GRAND CAYMAN BRANCH)</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    100.	SPREAD	+190 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX     DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC   0.375</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE 2000  NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
